  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Bay Pavilion spreads light blue radiance into a surrounding blue world, a storey building water elephant steps out as a defensive construct rather than a true lifeform. Fang Yuan names the immortal killer move Water Life Resurrection as Bay Pavilion forms more of these beasts for battle. After the upper extreme heavenly eagle destroys the first elephant, five seven-storey water elephants of ancient desolate level battle strength condense and charge. By Wu clan analysis the move involves transformation path, water path, and light path Immortal Gu, cannot be broken at once, and can greatly expend an enemy’s battle strength. Bai Ning Bing’s cold eyes freeze one elephant into ice, yet the blue light still passes through the ice and returns to Bay Pavilion unobstructed.",
      "chapters": [
        1377
      ],
